%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 200 200
%%Title: Curve Demo
%%Creator: Claude
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments

% Draw a large curved line with multiple segments
1 setlinewidth

% First curve - clear bezier shape
newpath
50 50 moveto
50 150 150 150 150 50 curveto
stroke

% Second curve - heart shape with multiple curves
newpath
100 50 moveto
120 80 160 90 160 120 curveto
160 150 130 160 100 130 curveto
70 160 40 150 40 120 curveto
40 90 80 80 100 50 curveto
closepath
stroke

% Draw a label
/Times-Roman findfont 12 scalefont setfont
50 180 moveto
(Curve Demonstration) show

showpage
%%EOF 